  m_Name: Carta_ZonaComercial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Zona Comercial
  _titleEn: Commercial Zone
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Reservar \xE1reas para com\xE9rcio concentra lojas e servi\xE7os, gera
    empregos e arrecada\xE7\xE3o."
  _summaryEn: Setting aside areas for commerce concentrates shops and services, creating
    jobs and tax revenue.
  _realWorld: "O zoneamento por uso come\xE7ou em Nova York em 1916 e se espalhou
    pelo mundo; as cidades brasileiras definem as zonas na lei de uso e ocupa\xE7\xE3o
    do solo."
  _realWorldEn: Zoning by use began in New York in 1916 and spread worldwide; Brazilian
    cities define zones in their land use laws.
  _tradeOffs: "Separar demais os usos esvazia o bairro \xE0 noite e obriga as pessoas
    a se deslocar de carro para tudo."
  _tradeOffsEn: Separating uses too much empties neighborhoods at night and forces
    people to drive for everything.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Zoneamento (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zoneamento
  - Label: Euclidean zoning (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euclidean_zoning
